# The Hero's burst button. For 20 seconds the Combo Counter is worth more, and
# every Raging Blow tears the space it swings through.
#
# The orb line looks like a fifth bonus per orb but isn't: it raises what the
# orbs ALREADY give by 13%, whichever skill gives it. GMS's own tables take
# Combo Attack's 20 ATT to 22.2 and Advanced Combo's 120% final damage to
# 133.2%, exactly that multiplier.
#
# Two of GMS's three clauses are dropped. The orb charge rate it halves does
# nothing here, since the orb count is fixed, and Soul Trace fires from Spirit
# Calibur, a 6th job skill this game never reaches.
#
# GMS says only "periodically" and keeps the number in Skill.wz, but a 41-second
# battle analysis settles it: 180 rifts over a 30-second window is 60 firings,
# one every half second, exactly one per Raging Blow. The tear follows the
# swing, not a clock, so a faster Hero tears more often.
#
# That is 7,200% per firing against the swing's own 1,548%, on purpose: the Hero
# is a burst job, much stronger with this up than without.
name: "Instinctual Combo"
description:
  "Tap into your subconscious abilities and use your power to its fullest "
  "potential. Increases the ability gained from the Combo Orb and allows you "
  "to leave a tear in space when Raging Blow is used. The tear in space is "
  "unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERO_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 20.0
  base { combo_orb_gain_pct: 0.043 }
  per_level { combo_orb_gain_pct: 0.003 }
  pulse {
    label: "Tear in Space"
    paced_by_skill_name: "Raging Blow"
    casts: 3
    lines: 6
    max_enemies: 6
    base { skill_pct: 1.97 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.07 }
  }
}
